#: 54603cb12752479cab53299ff1a88f9f
msgid "Each piece of content is of a kind that not only has one particular job to do, that job is also clearly distinguished from and contrasted with the other functions of documentation."
msgstr ""

#: c922f94f0d654ad29163939e3e32b67c
